	"name": "Shapeshifting",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/creatures/slimes/slime-movement-swirling-blue.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>As an action, a bacto sapiens can change their shape, texture, and color. This allows you to appear as another creature or object of medium or small size that you have interacted with, though this changes none of your character’s traits such as AC or HP.  In some cases this may allow you to perform the role of an object, such as a bucket, but it provides you no protection against damage caused by that use. This allows you control over your physical appearance, including hair, clothing, and coloration within the norms of the chosen Heritage. However, you gain no bonus to convincing others that you are a member of the heritage you appear as, or the object you take the form of, due to the natural sheen and slight discoloration of your component pieces.</p><p>You can use this ability for a total of 4 hours each day spent in 1 hour increments. You recover all use at the end of a long rest.</p>",
